Executive Summary

On 30 June 2026, an attacker successfully compromised the MedVitals AI AWS environment by exploiting an overly permissive IAM role. The attacker assumed the AdminFullAccess role, enumerated Amazon S3 buckets, created a compressed archive containing sensitive patient records, and subsequently downloaded the archive. The investigation confirmed a successful data exfiltration event involving confidential patient information. Immediate remediation is required to prevent further compromise and strengthen cloud security controls.

